          <div class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-slate-700 tracking-wider mb-2">📜 Historique Récent des Clics Sortants</div>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl max-h-48 overflow-y-auto">
